WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.750
Jamie jumps toward the cornered Ryu.

2
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:01.750
OD dive launches Ryu at the wall.

3
00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:02.350
Raw-Rush crouching heavy punch catches the launch.

4
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:03.750
OD Swagger Step continues the corner juggle.

5
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:04.550
The sweep target’s heavy kick continues the juggle.

6
00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:05.950
Jamie drinks at the end of the corner sweep target.
